w: grace_ and might_ of_ chiv-al-ry, The God for
"Bb" d c B | "F" A "C" G2 | "F" F2 F | A2 A | "C" G2 "Dm" F |
w: him_ wrought mar-v'lous-ly, Where-fore Eng-land may
F "A" E2 | "Dm" D2 "F" A/=B/ | "C" c/ d c/ G | "Em" =B "C" c/B/ "D" A | "G" G2 G |
w:  call and cry, De-----o gra---ti-as, De-
"C" G2 G |  G "F" F2 | A/B/ "C" c "Bb" B | "Am" A "C" G2 | "F" F2 A |
