w: All_ things are quite si-lent, each mor-tal_ at rest, When_
"Dm" F E>D |"C" c "G" d>c | "Am" A>B c |"Dm" A2 A/A/ |
w: me and my true love got snug in one nest, When a
"G" d  c B |"Am" c B A |"Em" B>A G |"F" c3- | c A/G/ |
w: bold set of ruf-fians they en-tered our cave,_ And they
