w: A_ black-smith court-ed me, nine months or bet-ter._ He_
%
"Dm" F D F G | "C" c3 G | "Dm" A3/2 D/ "C" C "Dm" D- | D2 A3/2 B/ |
w: fair-ly won my heart, wrote me a let-ter._ With his
%
