w: When I was ap-pren-ticed in Lon-don I went to see my dear.__ The
"Dm" D D "C" E/D/ C | "Dm" D2 "C" E G | "Dm" A A "C" G E | "Dm" D3 A |
w: cand-les all_ were burn-ing, the moon shone bright and clear. I
