W: 1. 'Twas on a Monday morning
W: Right early in the year,
W: When Charlie cam' to our town
W: The young Chevalier.
W:
W:
W: (Refrain:)
W: Charlie is m' darling, m' darling, m' darling,
W: Charlie is m' darling, the young Chevalier.
W:
