w: Come_|all you mar-_ ried|sea-_ men bold, A few|lines to you_ I’ll | write,|Just to|
"D" A2 F2 A2 Bc |"G" d2 c2 B2 (AF) |"D" D3 D DF A2 |"A" A6 |$ FG |"D" A2 F2 A2 Bc |
w: let you know how the|game do go when_|you are out_ of|sight,|Just to|let you know how the|
"G" d2 c2 B2 (AF) |"D" D2 D2 (DF) A2 |"A7" A6 |$ (FE) |"D" D2 F2 (FE) D2 |"G" (GA) B2 B2 (AF) |
