W: Chorus:
W: Way, haul away, we're bound
W: For better weather, to me,
W: Way, haul away, we'll haul away Joe.
W:
W: 2. First I met a Yankee girl,
W: And she was fat and lazy, to me,
W: Way, haul away, we'll haul away Joe.
W: Then I met an Irish girl,
W: She damn near drove me crazy, to me,
W: Way, haul away, we'll haul away Joe.
W: (Chorus)
W:
W: 3. King Louis was the king of France,
W: Before the revolution,
W: Way, haul away, we'll haul away Joe.
W: And then he got his head cut off,
W: It spoiled his constitution,
W: Way, haul away, we'll haul away Joe.
W: (Chorus 2x)
