"C" C3 G | c c "G" B>G |"F" A G "C" E C | E>G "G7" F D |
w:land, His name has stood through ag-es good and will for-ev-er
"C" C3 G | c c "G" B>G | "F" A G "C" E C | EG | "F" A G "C" E C | E>G "G7" F D |
