%
W: 1. Come all ye maids who live at a distance
W: Many a mile from off your love
W: Come and assist me this very moment
W: For to pass away some time
W: Singing sweetly and completely
W: Songs of pleasure and of love
W: My heart is with you all together
W: Though I live not where I love.
W:
W: 2. When I sleep I dream about you
W: When I wake I find no rest
W: Every moment thinking of you
W: My heart fied within your breast
W: Though great distance may prove assistance
W: From my mind your love to remove
W: My heart is with you all together
W: Though I live not where I love.
W:
W: 3. All the world shall be one religion
W: All living things should cease to die
W: If ever I prove false to my jewel
W: Any way my love deny
W: The world would change and be most strange
W: If ever I inconstant prove
W: My heart is with you all together
W: Though I live not where I love.
W:
W: 4. So farewell lads and farewell lasses
W: Now I think I've got my choice
W: I'll away to yonder island
W: Where I think I hear your voice
W: If you call then I will follow
W: Though the ocean be so wide
W: My heart is with you all together
W: Though I live not where I love.
%
