D E F D "C" G2 F G | "Dm" A2 c A "C" (GF) D C |$ "Dm" D3/2 E/2 F D "C" G2 (FG) | "Dm" A2 c A "C" (GF) D C | "Dm" D6 z2 |]
w:plough- man for to kiss, For his|breath smells as sweet_ as a|rose, a rose, a rose, His_|breath smells as sweet_ as a|rose!"|
