w:ly, Down _ the bor-een came a sweet col-leen, And she smiled as she passed me
"Am" A6ee | "C" g2 e2 e2 dc | "G" d2 d2 "Em" e2cd | "Am" e2 dc "F" A2 GE |
w:by. Oh, she looked so sweet from her two bare feet To the crown of her nut brown _
"G" G6EG | "Am" A2 A2 "F" A2 GA | "C" c2 c2 "G" d2cd |"Am" e2 dc "F" A2 G2 || "Am" A6 \
