ee | "C" g2 e2 e2 dc | "G" d2 d2 "Em" e2cd | "Am" e2 dc "F" A2 GE |
w:And from Ban-try Bay up to Der-ry Quay, And from Gal-way to Dub-lin _
"G" G6EG| "Am"A2 A2 "F" A2 GA |"C" c2 c2 "G" d2cd | "Am" e2 dc "F" A2 G2 |  "Am" A8 |]
w:town, No _ maid I've seen like the sweet col-leen That I met in the Coun-ty Down.
