w:born and raised in Ire_land in a place called Cas-tle-maine._ He
"C"G>c | c>B | "G" BA | "Dm" D>E | "G" FA | "C"G2- | G> G |
w:was his fath-er's on-ly son, his moth-er's pride and joy._ And
